{
    "title": "Plamfy: Live Stream Video Chat",
    "description": "Welcome to Plamfy! Plamfy is a top rated live streaming app and social network. Here you can watch broadcasts of streamers, and vloggers from all around the world, make friends and meet new people. So what are you waiting for? JOIN LIVE STREAM now!\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf1f\u2734\ufe0fCHECK NEW FEATURES JUST RELEASED \ud83c\udf1f\u2734\ufe0f\r\n\r\n\ud83e\udd47Live Battles Between Streamers \ud83e\udd47\r\nVote for your favorite streamer and make him or her win by sending gifts. More gifts = more chances for your streamer to win.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcac 1-to-1 chats \ud83d\udcac\r\nText the person you like not only in live chat but directly. Just open the profile of your user you are interested in and write a message. It\u2019s the fastest and easiest way to make new friends.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf89Party with your community \ud83c\udf89\r\nCreate live video parties with your friends and live stream together! Make fun together while having a smooth live video streaming experience.\r\n\r\n* * *\r\n\r\n\r\nPlamfy was designed to make your watching experience smooth and convenient: just install our live app, choose the stream you like and have fun. Wanna send a reaction, comment or go live chat? Login in 1 click and join live-chat.\r\n\r\nWe are incredibly proud of the global community of streamers we are building: you can watch dancers, singers, chefs, athletes, gamers, travelers or mega eaters streaming 24/7.\r\nYou are one step away from useful, inspiring, marvelous content.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udef0 Join Live Stream\r\nJust install the app and choose the live stream you want to watch. Watch any broadcast for free. It has never been that easy!\r\n\r\n\u200b\u200b\ud83d\udd10 Register to join live chat\r\nJust sign in using your Facebook or Google account. Now you can interact with users, encourage streamers, and share your feedback.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcac Communicate in online live chat\r\nGet a chance to interact with your favorite streamer. Text in live chat that appears in every live stream. Send reactions, share feedback on what is happening on the screen. Streamers will definitely appreciate it!\r\n\r\n\ud83e\udd33 Start your own live stream\r\nRather than watching others live streams you can start your own broadcast. Push the button and show the world what you are talented at! Become a star in live streaming free, broadcast your talents to your fans online: singing, dancing, talking or gaming.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcb8 Earn with only doing what you like:\r\n\ud83d\udd38 Grow community of your fans\r\n\ud83d\udd38 Interact with the audience in your show, find new friends\r\n\ud83d\udd38 Receive support from watchers\r\n\ud83d\udd38 Share precious moments, special events, show your talents\r\n\ud83d\udd38 Live stream from anywhere, have fun\r\n\ud83d\udd38 Share exclusive content with the most committed fans\r\n\r\nAll the Plamfy users can INTERACT with each other in live video chat: just join the live stream and leave the comment. Comment, express your thoughts, find new friends.\r\n\r\n** FOLLOW US ON SOCIAL MEDIA **\r\n\r\nFacebook: facebook.com/PlamfyApp\r\nInstagram: instagram.com/plamfyapp\r\nTwitter: twitter.com/Plamfy_App\r\n\r\n** SHARE YOUR FEEDBACK **\r\nWe care a lot about our community that\u2019s why we are committed to making Plamfy better. Please feel free to suggest any changes / fixes / modifications so we can grow and build a safe platform for everyone. All you emails will be appreciated: app@plamfy.com",
    "descriptionHTML": "Welcome to Plamfy! Plamfy is a top rated live streaming app and social network. Here you can watch broadcasts of streamers, and vloggers from all around the world, make friends and meet new people. So what are you waiting for? JOIN LIVE STREAM now!<br><br>\ud83c\udf1f\u2734\ufe0fCHECK NEW FEATURES JUST RELEASED \ud83c\udf1f\u2734\ufe0f<br><br>\ud83e\udd47Live Battles Between Streamers \ud83e\udd47<br>Vote for your favorite streamer and make him or her win by sending gifts. More gifts = more chances for your streamer to win.<br><br>\ud83d\udcac 1-to-1 chats \ud83d\udcac<br>Text the person you like not only in live chat but directly. Just open the profile of your user you are interested in and write a message. It\u2019s the fastest and easiest way to make new friends.<br><br>\ud83c\udf89Party with your community \ud83c\udf89<br>Create live video parties with your friends and live stream together! Make fun together while having a smooth live video streaming experience.<br><br>* * *<br><br><br>Plamfy was designed to make your watching experience smooth and convenient: just install our live app, choose the stream you like and have fun. Wanna send a reaction, comment or go live chat? Login in 1 click and join live-chat.<br><br>We are incredibly proud of the global community of streamers we are building: you can watch dancers, singers, chefs, athletes, gamers, travelers or mega eaters streaming 24/7.<br>You are one step away from useful, inspiring, marvelous content.<br><br>\ud83d\udef0 Join Live Stream<br>Just install the app and choose the live stream you want to watch. Watch any broadcast for free. It has never been that easy!<br><br>\u200b\u200b\ud83d\udd10 Register to join live chat<br>Just sign in using your Facebook or Google account. Now you can interact with users, encourage streamers, and share your feedback.<br><br>\ud83d\udcac Communicate in online live chat<br>Get a chance to interact with your favorite streamer. Text in live chat that appears in every live stream. Send reactions, share feedback on what is happening on the screen. Streamers will definitely appreciate it!<br><br>\ud83e\udd33 Start your own live stream<br>Rather than watching others live streams you can start your own broadcast. Push the button and show the world what you are talented at! Become a star in live streaming free, broadcast your talents to your fans online: singing, dancing, talking or gaming.<br><br>\ud83d\udcb8 Earn with only doing what you like:<br>\ud83d\udd38 Grow community of your fans<br>\ud83d\udd38 Interact with the audience in your show, find new friends<br>\ud83d\udd38 Receive support from watchers<br>\ud83d\udd38 Share precious moments, special events, show your talents<br>\ud83d\udd38 Live stream from anywhere, have fun<br>\ud83d\udd38 Share exclusive content with the most committed fans<br><br>All the Plamfy users can INTERACT with each other in live video chat: just join the live stream and leave the comment. Comment, express your thoughts, find new friends.<br><br>** FOLLOW US ON SOCIAL MEDIA **<br><br>Facebook: facebook.com/PlamfyApp<br>Instagram: instagram.com/plamfyapp<br>Twitter: twitter.com/Plamfy_App<br><br>** SHARE YOUR FEEDBACK **<br>We care a lot about our community that\u2019s why we are committed to making Plamfy better. Please feel free to suggest any changes / fixes / modifications so we can grow and build a safe platform for everyone. All you emails will be appreciated: app@plamfy.com",
